% p22_num_subst -- discriminates SUBSTITUTION of a numeral into a dependent
% codomain: `f 7 : P 7` is reachable only by substituting the numeral for
% var 0 in `P (var 0)`. The kernel comment claims k_subst needs NO numeral
% case because a numeral is closed; this is the fixture that demonstrates it
% rather than assuming it.
0 sort 0
axiom I64 : 0
numtype I64
1 const I64
2 sort 0
3 pi 1 2
axiom P : 3
4 const I64
5 const P
6 var 0
7 app 5 6
8 pi 4 7
axiom f : 8
9 const f
10 num 7
11 app 9 10
12 const P
13 num 7
14 app 12 13
check 11 : 14
